REX command-line tools

The CMake `tools` target builds these installed executables:

* moveDeclarationToInnermostScope moves variable declarations into their
  innermost usable scopes. Its regressions are in
  tests/nonsmoke/functional/moveDeclarationTool/.
* classMemberVariablesInLambdas reports explicit and implicit `this` captures.
* globalVariablesInLambdas reports global-variable references in lambdas.
* featureVector writes a textual inventory of source-located AST nodes and
  their type and preprocessing information to a .FV.txt file. See --help for
  its output options and --rose:help for frontend options.
* checkFortranInterfaces compares C and Fortran procedure interfaces and
  prints whether they match. This tool requires ENABLE-FORTRAN.

The tools accept the compiler arguments needed to parse their input files.
